The DivineSticker artwork in this directory (every .webp file) is dedicated to
the public domain by Divine under CC0 1.0 Universal.

To the extent possible under law, Divine has waived all copyright and related
or neighboring rights to this artwork.
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The artwork was generated by an AI image model from text prompts written for
Divine. PROVENANCE.md records the prompt, the generation record and the file
hashes of every sticker.
